 "remarks": "Beautifully renovated legal two-family home in a convenient location. Unit 1 features 4 bedrooms and 2 full bathrooms across two levels, including a finished walkout lower level with private entrance. Unit 2 offers 3 bedrooms and 1 full bathroom. Extensive exterior improvements include new vinyl siding, a new roof, thermopane windows, a newly paved driveway, deck, and professional landscaping. Interior updates feature modern kitchens with quartz countertops and stainless steel appliances, fully renovated bathrooms, recessed lighting, refinished hardwood floors, and new moldings, trim, and paint throughout. Both units benefit from newly installed central air conditioning. An excellent opportunity for investors or owner-occupants seeking a move-in-ready property with strong income potential.",
